Android 18&gt; Z-Battle Cards is in a battle: Use this card from your Warp in a combo.', '["Saiyan"]', '["Son Goku: GT"]', '["Super 17 Saga"]', '["Permanent","Critical","Activate: Main","Limit 1","Activate: Battle"]', NULL, 0, 0, 7, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '[]', '[]');
