[br]
[auto][once per turn] When you deal damage to your opponent by attacking with a blue card, look at up to 3 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 blue ≪Earthling≫ card to your hand, then place the remaining cards into their owner''s Drop.
[br]
[awaken] when your life is at 4 or less: Draw 2 cards.', '<Badge variant="blue">Auto</Badge> When this card attacks, draw 1 card and add up to 1 card from your life to your hand. <br /> <Badge variant="blue">Auto</Badge><Badge variant="red">Once per turn</Badge> When you deal damage to your opponent by attacking with a blue card, look at up to 3 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 blue ≪Earthling≫ card to your hand, then place the remaining cards into their owner''s Drop. <br /> <Badge variant="yellow">Awaken</Badge> when your life is at 4 or less: Draw 2 cards.', '["Earthling"]', '["Pilaf","Shu","Mai"]', '["Young Son Goku Saga"]', '[]', NULL, 0, 0, 4, 'Pilaf, Shu, & Mai, Entrusted Ambitions', '15000', '[auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.
[br]
[auto][once per turn] When you deal damage to your opponent by attacking with a blue card, look at up to 3 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 blue ≪Earthling≫ card to your hand, then place the remaining cards into their owner''s Drop.
[br]
[activate main]{u}{u}, place 7 of your mono-blue energy into its owner''s Drop: If you have 55 or more cards in your Drop, you win the game.', '<Badge variant="blue">Auto</Badge> When this card attacks, draw 1 card. <br /> <Badge variant="blue">Auto</Badge><Badge variant="red">Once per turn</Badge> When you deal damage to your opponent by attacking with a blue card, look at up to 3 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 blue ≪Earthling≫ card to your hand, then place the remaining cards into their owner''s Drop. <br /> <Badge variant="orange">Activate: Main</Badge><img src="/assets/img/dbs_masters/card_parts/blue_ball.png" alt="" class="colorCostBall"><img src="/assets/img/dbs_masters/card_parts/blue_ball.png" alt="" class="colorCostBall">, place 7 of your mono-blue energy into its owner''s Drop: If you have 55 or more cards in your Drop, you win the game.', '["Earthling"]', '["Pilaf","Shu","Mai"]', '["Young Son Goku Saga"]');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO cards (id, card_number, card_name, card_series, card_rarity, card_type, card_color, energy_cost_int, combo_cost_int, combo_power_int, power_int, card_energy_cost, card_combo_cost, card_combo_power, card_power, card_skill_unstyled, card_skill_html, card_traits_json, card_character_json, card_era_json, keywords_json, z_energy_cost, is_banned, is_limited, limited_to, card_back_name, card_back_power, card_back_skill_unstyled, card_back_skill_html, card_back_traits_json, card_back_character_json, card_back_era_json) VALUES (10044, 'BT30-067', 'SS4 Son Goku (Mini)', 'BT30', 'Uncommon[UC]', 'LEADER', 'Yellow', NULL, NULL, NULL, 10000, NULL, NULL, NULL, '10000', '[auto] When this card attacks, look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 yellow ≪Demon Realm≫ card to your hand, then shuffle your deck.
[br]
[awaken] When your life is at 4 or less, or you have 2 or more energy and a yellow Z-Unison with a specified cost of 1 in play: Draw 2 cards and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.', '<Badge variant="blue">Auto</Badge> When this card attacks, look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 yellow ≪Demon Realm≫ card to your hand, then shuffle your deck. <br /> <Badge variant="yellow">Awaken</Badge> When your life is at 4 or less, or you have 2 or more energy and a yellow Z-Unison with a specified cost of 1 in play: Draw 2 cards and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.', '["Saiyan","Demon Realm"]', '["Son Goku (Mini): DA"]', '["DAIMA Saga"]', '[]', NULL, 0, 0, 4, 'SS4 Son Goku, Apex Evolution', '15000', '[permanent][evolve] Skills on yellow ≪Demon Realm≫ cards in your hand can also activate at [counter play] timings.
[br]
[activate main/battle][once per turn] Play up to 1 yellow ≪Demon Realm≫ card with an energy cost of 1 from your deck or Drop in Rest Mode, then shuffle your deck.', '<Badge variant="purple">Permanent</Badge><Badge variant="red">Evolve</Badge> Skills on yellow ≪Demon Realm≫ cards in your hand can also activate at <Badge variant="green">Counter: Play</Badge> timings. <br /> <Badge variant="orange">Activate: Main/Battle</Badge><Badge variant="red">Once per turn</Badge> Play up to 1 yellow ≪Demon Realm≫ card with an energy cost of 1 from your deck or Drop in Rest Mode, then shuffle your deck.', '["Saiyan","Demon Realm"]', '["Son Goku: DA"]', '["DAIMA Saga"]');
