onally, that card gains <Badge variant="red">Servant</Badge> for the game if it does not have <Badge variant="red">Servant</Badge> already.', '["Machine Mutant","Saiyan","Great Ape"]', '["Baby"]', '["Baby Saga"]', '["Overlord","Once per turn","Z-Awaken","Auto","Servant","Activate: Main"]', '2', 0, 0, 7, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '[]', '[]');
