[br]
[auto] If your Leader is red, your life is at 4 or less, and all of your energy is red: When this card is used in a combo, it gets +10000 combo power for the battle. Additionally, you may place 1 card from your hand at the bottom of your deck. If you do, draw 2 cards.', '<Badge variant="red">Super Combo</Badge> <br /> <Badge variant="blue">Auto</Badge> If your Leader is red, your life is at 4 or less, and all of your energy is red: When this card is used in a combo, it gets +10000 combo power for the battle. Additionally, you may place 1 card from your hand at the bottom of your deck. If you do, draw 2 cards.', '["Android"]', '["Android 18"]', '["Android 13 Saga"]', '[]', NULL, 0, 0, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '[]', '[]');
