rn.<br /><Badge variant="orange">Activate: Main</Badge><img src="/assets/img/dbs_masters/card_parts/blue_ball.png" alt="" class="colorCostBall"><img src="/assets/img/dbs_masters/card_parts/blue_ball.png" alt="" class="colorCostBall">, if your Leader is blue, you have 3 or more energy, and you place 2 cards from your hand at the bottom of your deck: Play this card from your hand.', '["Saiyan","Earthling","Master''s Teachings"]', '["Son Gohan: SH"]', '["DBS: SUPER HERO Saga"]', '["Ultimate","Auto","Barrier","Activate: Main/Battle","Once per turn","Critical","Activate: Main"]', NULL, 0, 0, 7, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '[]', '[]');
