se, play up to 1 blue ≪Android≫ Z-Battle Card with an energy cost of 4 or less from under this card.', '["Android","Scientist"]', '["Android 21"]', '["Special"]', '["Unique","Critical","Z-Stack 1","Permanent","Auto"]', '1', 1, 0, 7, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '[]', '[]');
