[activate main][once per turn] Place up to 1 {Spirit} from your Z-Energy under this card.', '<Badge variant="red">Critical</Badge> <br /> <Badge variant="orange">Activate: Main</Badge><Badge variant="red">Limit 1</Badge>, if your Leader''s back side is {Super Saiyans United} and you have 2 or more energy: Play this card from your hand, then add up to 1 {Spirit} from your Drop to your Z-Energy. <br /> <Badge variant="orange">Activate: Main</Badge><Badge variant="red">Once per turn</Badge> Place up to 1 {Spirit} from your Z-Energy under this card.', '["Saiyan"]', '["Son Goku"]', '["Android 13 Saga"]', '[]', NULL, 0, 0, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '[]', '[]');
